          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: హామీ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "హామీ — hāmī — \"a guarantee; an assurance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ప్రభుత్వం రైతులకు సహాయం చేస్తామని హామీ ఇచ్చింది. prabhutvaṁ raitulaku sahāyaṁ cēstāmani hāmī iccindi. The government assured the farmers that it would help."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "హామీ (hāmī) ఇచ్చు, to promise, to guarantee."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "హామీ (hāmī) has an origin that is not settled; it may have come into Telugu through Hindustani."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
