          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నెరవేర్చు — neravērcu — \"to fulfil; to carry out\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "అతను తన వాగ్దానాన్ని నెరవేర్చాడు. atanu tana vāgdānānni neravērcāḍu. He kept his promise."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): నెరవేర్చాను, neravērcānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "For promises, wishes and duties: కోరిక నెరవేర్చు (neravērcu), to fulfil a wish."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నెరవేర్చు (neravērcu) is a Telugu verb whose origin is uncertain; DEDR has no article for it. Its intransitive partner is నెరవేరు, to come true."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
